/// M02 CORE-005 "bundled callables: captures roots green, silent run".
/// Source: tests/integration/callables_test.go symbol
/// TestCurrentBundledCallables.
/// Related fixtures: compiler/testdata/current/callables/captures.can
/// (ground for every root pin below: identity 1, combine 1, consume 1,
/// compute 2, through_field 1, make_box 1, read 1, receiver_capture 1,
/// through_array 1, main 1 = 11 roots).
/// Disposition: RETAIN (migrate row; the old Go harness stays until the
/// integrator retires it after every linked row, variant, environment and
/// control has accepted evidence).
/// Protects (this file): canlc assert green with passed report and exactly
/// 11 roots grounded per function in captures.can, silent production run
/// (exit 0, empty stdout, empty stderr).
/// Captured-callable root-context retention and the relay/no-relay
/// selection legs live in core-005-capture-semantics.can; the unsupplied
/// I/O boundary as missing fixture without payload leak lives in
/// core-005-io-boundary.can.
/// Variants: captures fixture. The selected guarded callable with and
/// without relay belongs to the sibling files.
/// Environment: CAN_BUN_ARCHIVE + macOS sandbox-exec; requires
/// can-bun-archive, macos-sandbox-exec. Logical gates SUITE/DIAG/FAULT and
/// C/R/N/S/A identities bind at P23; no live run now.
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23).
/// Case bundled/captures-roots checks: assert-green, report-passed,
/// root-count, fixture-name, identity-roots, combine-roots, consume-roots,
/// compute-roots, field-roots, box-roots, read-roots, receiver-roots,
/// array-roots, main-roots, run-silent.
/// Facet map (callables_test.go legs): assert-green pins the assert leg
/// (L69-72: exit 0, empty stderr); report-passed/root-count pin the report
/// leg (L73-76: passed true, 11 assertions); fixture-name grounds the 11
/// roots in captures.can; identity-roots pins identity (captures.can
/// L12-13: 4 => ok 4); combine-roots pins combine (L21-22: 3,4,5 => ok
/// 12); consume-roots pins consume (L29-30: callable identity, 4 => ok 4);
/// compute-roots pins compute (L39-40: first => ok 12, second => ok 22);
/// field-roots pins through_field (L48-49: 3,5 => ok 12); box-roots pins
/// make_box (L55-56: => ok box(7)); read-roots pins box read (L62-63:
/// box(7), 3 => ok 10); receiver-roots pins receiver_capture (L69-70: 3
/// => ok 10); array-roots pins through_array (L78-79: 3,5 => ok 12);
/// main-roots pins main (L86-87: [] => ok); run-silent pins the run leg
/// (L77-80: exit 0, empty stdout, empty stderr).
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later integrator decision.
